  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Serbian Commissariat for Refugees and Migration (Commissariat) to manage mixed migration at the national and local level &#x2013; Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In continuation of previous phases of this project, the International Organization for Migration is contributing to the Government of Serbia&#x2019;s management of mixed migration at the national and the local levels through the provision of technical support to the Commissariat in fulfilling its responsibilities in line with the Law on Migration Management (2012), the Law on Asylum and Temporary Protection (2018), as well as responsibilities laid out in the Law on Foreigners (2018). This project advances Serbia&#x2019;s progress towards achieving the objectives of the Global Compact for Migration, which envisages further enhancement of the capacities and human resources of the Serbian Commissariat for Refugees and Migration. Specifically, this project aims to strengthen the capacities of the Commissariat in the coordination and management of mixed migration movements.</narrative>
  </description>
